## 2. Step-by-Step `demo_backend.py` Execution Workflow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Demo Script
    participant Config as app.core.config
    participant Chunker as app.core.chunking
    participant Embedder as app.core.embeddings
    participant VStore as app.core.vectorstore
    participant Services as /services Registry

    User->>Config: 1. Load Backend Settings
    Config-->>User: embedding_model="text-embedding-3-small", chunk_size=500, top_k=5

    User->>Chunker: 2. Pass Sample Markdown Doc (779 chars)
    Note over Chunker: Apply Tiktoken sliding window (500 tokens, 50 overlap)
    Chunker-->>User: Return 1 Processed Chunk with Metadata

    User->>Embedder: 3. Generate Vector Embeddings (Simulated)
    Embedder-->>User: 1536-Dimensional Dense Float Array

    User->>VStore: 4. Upsert & Query Vector Store
    VStore-->>User: Top K Matched Chunks (Hybrid Similarity Score)

    User->>Services: 5. Inspect Microservices Routing
    Services-->>User: Auth (:8001), Ingestion (:8002), Worker (:8003), Retrieval (:8004)
```

---

## 3. Core Microservices Breakdown

| Service Name | Port | Key Function | Core Stack / Components |
| :--- | :---: | :--- | :--- |
| **Auth Service** | `:8001` | Authentication & Tenant Isolation | JWT validation, `sk-shiprag-...` key lookup |
| **Ingestion Service** | `:8002` | File parsing & async stream dispatch | Parsers (`PyPDF2`, `BeautifulSoup`), Redis Streams producer |
| **Embedding Worker** | `:8003` | Chunking & Vector Upserts | `app.core.chunking`, OpenAI / HuggingFace embeddings, `pgvector` |
| **Retrieval Service** | `:8004` | Hybrid Search RAG & LLM streaming | 70% dense vector + 30% BM25 keyword search, `claude-sonnet-4-6`, SSE |

